Subject: [PATCH] 1454: an introduction plan keeps nothing the model wrote
 before it (D739)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 53296, 0 of 3 on 0165: every run put a sentence before the plan in
words no list had („…ჯერ ვერსად ვიპოვე…", „…ნაპოვნია, ის ლიკას
კონტაქტია."), or merged one into the plan sentence. Three word-list rounds
did not hold, so for an introduction plan (the server's plan text carries
the plan sentence) the reply now starts at the model's plan sentence:

- everything before it goes, whatever its words;
- the model's own sentence stays only when it is the plan alone, i.e.
  it opens with the go-between's name and has no clause before the verb.
  Otherwise the server's own sentence stands in its place;
- with no plan sentence at all, the server's sentence is the reply.

No new words. The closing question is settled as before. Plans without
the server's plan sentence keep the earlier filters.

